        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary Suvorexant and its metabolite, hydroxy suvorexant, are present in low concentrations in breast milk with a relative infant dose of less than 1% following maternal oral administration (see Data ) .",
